{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p120b","title":"宋扬北宫玉推边章韩遂为首","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p120b-account","label":"《典略》","text":"凉州宋扬、北宫玉等起兵，推边章、韩遂为首；边章随后病卒，韩遂被劫而起兵，三十二年至死。","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0350","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0351","role":"起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0047","role":"被推病卒","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"被推起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"凉州","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]},"time":{"label":"起兵至死三十二年，不反推精确起年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p120b-q"]},"source_order":[1,1026,"P120b"],"order":384}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0350","name":"宋扬","evidence":["wudi-q-p120"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p120-wudi-p0350","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p120"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p120b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8c855643c67a12b18504","layer":"pei","quote":"会凉州宋扬、北宫玉等反，举章、遂为主。章寻病卒；遂为扬等所劫，不得已，遂阻兵为乱。积三十二年，至是乃死，年七十余矣。","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a5c0b079f6539aa1943e","start":72,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p120","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8c855643c67a12b18504","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《典略》曰：“遂字文约。始与同郡边章俱著名西州。章为督军从事。遂奉计，诣京师。何进宿闻其名，特与相见。遂说进，使诛诸阉人，进不从；乃求归。会凉州宋扬、北宫玉等反，举章、遂为主。章寻病卒；遂为扬等所劫，不得已，遂阻兵为乱。积三十二年，至是乃死，年七十余矣。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a5c0b079f6539aa1943e","start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit"